<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import, consumer price.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import, consumer price.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Producer prices   March	  unch, +0.6 pct     Apr 21</p>
<p> Import prices     March	  +0.5, +3.0 pct     Apr 25 or 28</p>
<p> Inflation (prelim)April	  -0.1, +1.6 pct     Apr 25 or 28</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets. The previous data show month-on-month change, followed by year-on-year change.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
